#DIMS SCENE    ;セリフの表示されるタイミング
#DIM  CLIENT_ID;依頼者IDだけ抜き出したもの
;--------------------------------------------------
;RETURN 0 の部分は共通の口上が表示されます
;依頼ごとの口上を表示する部分は RETURN 0 を RETURN 1 にしてください
;--------------------------------------------------
SELECTCASE SCENE
CASE "依頼提示時"
    $FIRSTSEE
	PRINTFORML 「Most characters in this world will excrete a liquid known as%TW_PORT_STR("Pee",1)%.」
	PRINTFORML 「%TW_PORT_STR("Pee",1)% is stored in your bladder and is accumulated as you drink as well as time.」
	PRINTFORML 「Once you have enough pee, you'll start to get the need to go, and as a result need to find a way to%TW_PORT_STR("Relieve Yourself",0)%.」
    PRINTFORML 「As you become more desperate to pee, you'll be unable to focus and will do things much worse until you relieve yourself.」
    PRINTL
	PRINTFORML 「It's essential that you go to a 『Toilet』and【Relieve Yourself】when you feel the need to go.」
	PRINTFORML 「This will allow you to empty your bladder and increase your continence.」
    PRINTFORML 「If you can't get to a toilet or relieve yourself in another way, you'll have a『Bladder Accident』.」
	RETURN 1
CASE "Levels of Desperation"
    PRINTFORML 「There are 8 levels of desperation, with each of them getting harder to hold.」
    PRINTFORML 「%PeeBarStageName(0)%: Your bladder is completely empty, no penalties.」
    PRINTFORML 「%PeeBarStageName(2)%: You start to feel the need to pee, This is the stage where you start using a toilet. No penalties.」
    PRINTFORML 「%PeeBarStageName(3)%: You're starting to squirm around the place. Light penalties.」
    PRINTFORML 「%PeeBarStageName(4)%: You feel like you really need to pee. Medium penalties」
    PRINTFORML 「%PeeBarStageName(5)%: Your bladder feels like it's about to burst. Heavy penalties」
    PRINTFORML 「%PeeBarStageName(6)%: Your bladder has reached it's limit on what it can hold. Heavy penalties + chance to leak pee.」
    PRINTFORML 「%PeeBarStageName(7)%: You can't hold it in any longer and your bladder muscles have given out. An accident is inevitable.」
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML 「Holding your pee will increase your pee holding EXP until you start leaking, where you then start losing EXP.」
    PRINTFORML 「Training continence usually involves holding yourself until you start to leak, as well as using the toilet on time.」
CASE "Toileting"
    PRINTFORML 「Some bathrooms have a%TW_PORT_STR("Toilet",1)%that can be used to relieve yourself.」
    PRINTFORML 「Using a toilet will empty your %PeeAndPoo(nPee,nScat,"bladder","bowels")%, removing any debuffs related to desperation.」
    PRINTFORML 「Most toilets are%TW_PORT_STR("Private",1)%, which means that they can only hold one person at a time.」
    PRINTFORML 「%TW_PORT_STR("Public",1)%toilets allow as many people to use them.」
    PRINTFORML 「Keep in mind that some religions may ban the use of a toilet.」
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML 「Using a toilet requires you to be dexterous enough to take off your clothes in time.」
    PRINTFORML 「Failing to take off your clothes in time will result in your having an accident when heading to the toilet.」
    PRINTFORML 「Having enough wetting addiction may result in you failing to attempt to pull down your underwear when on the toilet.」
    PRINTFORML 「This will result in you soiling your underwear, even though you technically "made it".」
CASE "Intake"
    PRINTFORML 「When you drink something, your liquid intake increases.」
    PRINTFORML 「This increases pee gained as you digest the water that you just drunk. It also makes pee less concentrated.」
    PRINTFORML 「More water means a lighter pee, while less water will result in darker pee.」
    PRINTFORML 「Keep in mind that peeing will decrease the concentration of further urine.」
    PRINTFORML 「Less concentrated pee will build up more than more concentrated pee.」
    PRINTFORML 「Pale Yellow to Pale Amber pee means you or the character has a healthy concentration. Anything darker is too concentrated and Clear means too much water.」
CASE "Continence"
    PRINTFORML 「Each character has bladder continence level and bladder size. Together they make an effective continence level.」
    PRINTFORML 「Higher levels mean being able to hold more pee, while lower levels mean the opposite.」
CASE "Public Urination"
    PRINTFORML 「When a Touhou is desperate for a leak and no bathrooms are available, they may consider peeing in public.」
    PRINTFORML 「This involves them going outside, moving to a secluded area, pulling down their underwear, and peeing.」
    PRINTFORML 「While it is less punishing than an accident, peeing in public is still discourteous and makes witnesses give you the 【Not Potty Trained】 reputation.」
CASE "Accidents"
    PRINTFORML 「Failing to relieve yourself in time will make you have an accident.」
    PRINTFORML 「This will soil your clothes, affect your continence, and make witnesses give you the 【Not Potty Trained】 reputation.」
    PRINTFORML 「If you are wearing a diaper or pad with enough capacity to absorb your accident, no one will bat an eye.」
    PRINTFORML 「If the pad is unable to hold your accident, you might need boosters or go up a tier of padding.」
    PRINTFORML 「A wetting is generally embarrassing to the character in question, and can result in a bad mood.」
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML 「Having multiple accidents will result in you feeling pleasure when they happen. This is called an Addiction.」
    PRINTFORML 「They also make it harder to not flood your undies when heading to the toilet, so there's that.」
    PRINTL
    PRINTFORML 「It's best to not have accidents if you can control them, else use protection.」

CASE "依頼非受託時"
	PRINTDATAL
		DATAFORM 「You don't have to come with me, though you're better off if you do.」
	ENDDATA
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼受託時"
	PRINTDATAW
		DATAFORM 「Thank you. I know you probably need me to guide you.」
	ENDDATA
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼確認時"
    GOTO FIRSTSEE
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼破棄時"
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼実行直前"
    RETURN 0
CASE "依頼実行直後"
	RETURN 0
CASE "成功報告時"
;報酬： 
	RETURN 1
CASE "失敗報告時"
	PRINTDATAL
		DATAFORM 「Ah, you can always do another then.」
	ENDDATA
	RETURN 1
	;IF !RESULT
	;	PRINTFORML
CASE "依頼報告不要"
	RETURN 0
ENDSELECT

